      "summary": "Hale led fifty riders of the Vanguard from Elerian Keep toward Crossroads Keep. Edren packed waterskins and lost one at Aldermarch. Brannic reset Night's foreshoe. At the Broken Spur, Tobin reported that Lord Darius doubled the toll at Valen Ford, and Jory reported riders in the Northwood. Hale paid the toll from Aldric's purse. The riders proved to be a Crossroads patrol. Marten cut his arm and Orren stitched it.",
      "when": "Blossomtide 14 to 18, 348",
      "people": "Hale, Heather, Edren, Aldric, Marten, Tobin, Jory, Orren, Darius",
      "places": "Elerian Keep, Harren's Cross, Valen Ford, Crying Rock, Crossroads Keep",
      "settled": "The Northwood riders were an escort from Lord Darius.",
      "closed": ""
     },
